WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:02.700
<v Interviewer>Thanks for joining us. Where did it start?

00:02.700 --> 00:05.400
<v Narrator>In a small studio, with one microphone.

00:05.400 --> 00:08.100
<v Narrator>We played it back that evening.

00:08.100 --> 00:10.700
<v Interviewer>And that sound is what the archive kept?

00:10.700 --> 00:13.400
<v Narrator>Exactly that. Every hiss and footstep.

00:13.400 --> 00:16.100
<v Interviewer>Reading along, it plays like a film.

00:16.100 --> 00:18.800
<v Narrator>The words arrive as you hear them.

00:18.800 --> 00:21.500
<v Interviewer>Then the last word goes to the recording.

00:21.500 --> 00:23.866
<v Narrator>Thank you.
